OL,3,GNEWSADay marking victims of terrorist
OL,4,Aattacks recognises 'my brother's life
OL,5,Amattered'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK's first national day for victims
OL,8,Fand survivors of terrorism has been
OL,9,Fheld in London where those affected by
OL,10,Fthe violence of the Troubles were in
OL,11,Fattendance.
OL,13,FThe day aimed to recognise people
OL,14,Fimpacted by terrorism including victims
OL,15,Fand their families, witnesses and the
OL,16,Femergency services, as well as raising
OL,17,Fawareness about specialist support.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
