OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADay marking victims of terrorist
OL,4,Aattacks recognises 'my brother's life
OL,5,Amattered'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the rest of the UK, these could be
OL,8,Fterror attacks such as the London
OL,9,FBridge terror attack, the Manchester
OL,10,FArena attack in 2017 or the 7/7
OL,11,Fbombings.
OL,13,FBut in Northern Ireland, many will be
OL,14,Fremembering the atrocities of the
OL,15,FTroubles, which lasted 30 years and
OL,16,Fcost the lives of more than 3,500
OL,17,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
